From: Natalie Vock <natalie.vock@gmx.de>
Subject: [PATCH] drm: vram management improvements (vramstuff-rebase, 28 commits combined)

Combined diff of the vramstuff-rebase branch (28 commits by Natalie Vock),
rebased onto Linux master 1200d84f4c0a929a0780180d25063d93773be79c.

Contains: dmem cgroup protection queries, TTM refcount/LRU/eviction
rework, drm_exec conversion, amdgpu/xe VRAM management improvements,
VRAM claim throttling, eviction priority.

